WEBVTT

00:12:56.167 --> 00:13:00.976
God forbid my children
go through what I went through.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.559
I, at the very least, want them to know

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:07.101
that sexual assault is not,

00:13:07.125 --> 00:13:08.726
never was

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.458
and never will be their fault.

00:13:12.708 --> 00:13:13.958
Thank you.